    "name": "Pawns of War",
    "steam_appid": 3509740,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Searching for a ray of salvation inside this nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2044. There is a war going on in the world between two superpowers. On neutral territory, you will have to guard the base as usual, but suddenly the war catches up with you here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to assemble a squad of different characters, equip them, give them weapons and join the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509740/extras/f26c42ead8723298b8be9b6f970b90aa.avif?t=1753469280\" data-has-big width=800 height=299 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battle scene is presented in the form of 3x3 cells. Place the units correctly on it, choose the battlefield and win against a randomly generated enemy units.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509740/extras/f0361ddd7cd86753e19eea6f522faf93.avif?t=1753469280\" data-has-big width=800 height=303 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your characters, buy weapons in the store for in-game currency, and perform daily boss battles.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509740/extras/eea788b59a12b18811fa368c2a461f9e.avif?t=1753469280\" data-has-big width=800 height=303 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience fear and anxiety when faced with unknown nightmares, manage your resources carefully.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509740/extras/88735e080809fbb1a450bc8bef04de41.avif?t=1753469280\" data-has-big width=800 height=299 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric action autobattler and a short-story about personality, memory, as well as the horrors of the unknown and unknowable awaits you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Searching for a ray of salvation inside this nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2044. There is a war going on in the world between two superpowers. On neutral territory, you will have to guard the base as usual, but suddenly the war catches up with you here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to assemble a squad of different characters, equip them, give them weapons and join the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509740/extras/f26c42ead8723298b8be9b6f970b90aa.avif?t=1753469280\" data-has-big width=800 height=299 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battle scene is presented in the form of 3x3 cells. Place the units correctly on it, choose the battlefield and win against a randomly generated enemy units.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509740/extras/f0361ddd7cd86753e19eea6f522faf93.avif?t=1753469280\" data-has-big width=800 height=303 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your characters, buy weapons in the store for in-game currency, and perform daily boss battles.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509740/extras/eea788b59a12b18811fa368c2a461f9e.avif?t=1753469280\" data-has-big width=800 height=303 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience fear and anxiety when faced with unknown nightmares, manage your resources carefully.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509740/extras/88735e080809fbb1a450bc8bef04de41.avif?t=1753469280\" data-has-big width=800 height=299 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric action autobattler and a short-story about personality, memory, as well as the horrors of the unknown and unknowable awaits you.</p>",
